1.Description

   Integrated professionally designed promotional healthcare banners into the Pharma Store homepage to improve user engagement, highlight key pharmacy services, and create a visually appealing landing experience. The implementation focused on displaying marketing banners for healthcare services, medicine subscriptions, AI healthcare assistance, and pharmacy promotions while maintaining responsive behavior across all devices.

   The promotional banners were designed to improve customer awareness, encourage interaction with healthcare services, and increase product visibility through engaging visual content and strategic call-to-action placement.

2.Business Requirement

   The Pharma Store homepage required an engaging promotional banner section to communicate the pharmacy's primary services and ongoing healthcare offerings. The banner system needed to support multiple promotional campaigns while providing a seamless user experience across desktop, tablet, and mobile devices.

3.The solution needed to:

   Promote pharmacy services.
   Highlight medicine subscription plans.
   Advertise AI Healthcare Assistant.
   Increase customer engagement.
   Improve homepage visual appeal.
   Support future marketing campaigns.
   Encourage customer interaction through CTA buttons.

